			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Alrani"
				],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1547.319,
							56.618,
							8115.397
						],
						"pointId": 350400097
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1544.858,
							56.741,
							8114.367
						],
						"pointId": 350400098
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1546.831,
							56.704,
							8112.335
						],
						"pointId": 350400120
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 250310401,
					"content": "Thank you, thanks for your help...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310402,
					"content": "If I could have gotten rid of that damn bag earlier, I would have taken care of them all by myself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Narzam"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310403,
					"content": "No way! Then we'd have come to Natlan for nothing!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310404,
					"content": "Hold up, are you... Alrani?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310405
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250310405,
					"content": "#Huh? Y—You're {NICKNAME}, aren't you? It's really you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310406,
					"content": "This lady next to you, surely it's not...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310407
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250310407,
					"content": "Narzam, Treasure Hoarder. We've met before. You haven't forgotten, have you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Narzam"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310408,
					"content": "Phew... You really are my savior! How many times have you saved me now? Once, twice...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310409,
					"content": "I hope you're not counting that time you were with me. That happened because you insisted on staying.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Narzam"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310410,
					"content": "Of course I'm not counting that time. And what do you mean I insisted on staying? I already paid you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310411,
					"content": "Yeah, just about enough to cover food and drinks...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Narzam"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310412,
					"content": "Don't tell me you're here for your thesis again?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310413
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250310413,
					"content": "Hehe, well... Given the countless hours of hard work I've put into it, I couldn't just let it all go to waste, could I...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310414,
					"content": "I applied for special funding from the Akademiya this time, and I even settled on a research topic as original as it gets.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310415,
					"content": "Besides, I have Narzam with me as my guard. She's chased all the bad guys away.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310416,
					"content": "Probably more just the fact that we're not carrying anything valuable enough to make it worth their while...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310417,
						250310418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Narzam"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310417,
					"content": "But in the end...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310419
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250310419,
					"content": "...All this way, right from when we set out from the Children of Echoes, this girl's been clutching that bag with all her documents in as if it were a baby.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Narzam"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310420,
					"content": "To be honest, even to me, she looks like some fool clinging on to treasure.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Narzam"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310421,
					"content": "And someone carrying treasure, walking through an empty wilderness with only a single guard to protect her... Who wouldn't give that a try?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Narzam"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310422,
					"content": "Well, you're right about one thing... My bag is indeed full of treasure! Not only does it contain all my field interview records, but copies of various documents too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310423,
					"content": "Armed with treasures like these, I'll have no problem writing my thesis!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310424,
					"content": "And my chosen topic — the \"Pilgrimage of the Return of the Sacred Flame.\" It's a subject of great importance, so I'll surely be able to graduate.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310425,
					"content": "Oh, and of course, I couldn't have done it without Tahmures. This was her idea in the first place! She really is a great friend, teehee...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310426,
					"content": "#Thank you once again, {NICKNAME}. If it wasn't for you, those bad guys would not only have ruined my books, they'd have stolen my money too!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310427,
					"content": "A while back, I finally managed to earn a bit of pocket money by helping organize some books and materials. If it had been stolen, I wouldn't be able to afford any new materials myself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310428,
					"content": "True, but you'd end up spending all your money on books regardless. If I hadn't confiscated your wallet, we'd have gone hungry for sure...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310429
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Narzam"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310429,
					"content": "I—I don't buy that many books... do I...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310430,
					"content": "Anyway, that's enough talk for now. We still need to head over to the People of the Springs to gather materials.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310431
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310431,
					"content": "Goodbye then! My thesis shall be finished next we meet — I guarantee it! And when that time comes, I'll treat you to a delicious meal!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Alrani"
				},
				{
					"id": 250310418,
					"content": "You still wound up running into trouble.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250310419
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2503105,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2503105
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
